{"id":"n36743-1-8","stage":5,"title":"국방부 · 国防部","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n36743-1-8-1","ko":"국방부 발표에 따르면 이웃 국가 사람들이 몰래 국경을 넘어오는 일이 빈번하게 일어난대.","zh":"据国防部发布的消息，有邻国的人频繁偷偷越过边境进入我国。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"국방부","meaning":"国防部","explanation":"국방부：国防部","readings":[{"term":"국방부","audio":"/audio/aa3d3145928c107267a1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36743","senseId":"1","lemma":"국방부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"발표에","meaning":"发表，发布","explanation":"발표：发表，发布；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"발표","audio":"/audio/662fbb8d7bdeae8019f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62470","senseId":"1","lemma":"발표","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따르면","meaning":"按照","explanation":"따르다：按照；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"따르다","audio":"/audio/3ad4e3c6c1e70deec620.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64547","senseId":"8","lemma":"따르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이웃","meaning":"邻，比邻","explanation":"이웃：邻，比邻","readings":[{"term":"이웃","audio":"/audio/56a0fd1527d122372c76.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31487","senseId":"1","lemma":"이웃","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국가","meaning":"国家","explanation":"국가：国家","readings":[{"term":"국가","audio":"/audio/10a6c77fd1f313a630c4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62382","senseId":"1","lemma":"국가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사람들이","meaning":"人们，大家","explanation":"사람：人们，大家；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"8","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몰래","meaning":"偷偷地，暗中","explanation":"몰래：偷偷地，暗中","readings":[{"term":"몰래","audio":"/audio/c8aea3f746ec0b30b7d5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56016","senseId":"1","lemma":"몰래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"국경을","meaning":"国境，边境","explanation":"국경：国境，边境；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","rea